#
# Open Build Service 2.10.35
#

Please read the README.md file for initial installation
instructions or use the OBS Appliance from

  http://openbuildservice.org/download/

The dist/README.UPDATERS file has information for people updating
from a previous OBS release.

========
Bugfixes
========

Frontend:
 * Update crass RubyGem to version 1.0.7
   - [GHSA-6wmf-3r64-vcwv] Large numeric exponents cause CPU and memory denial of service
 * Bug fix LDAP Group handling
   - See https://github.com/openSUSE/open-build-service/pull/12623
